<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Golden Cape - 100,000 tonnes coal Hampton roads/Constanza $7.25 30,000/15,000 10-25/4 Deiulemar.</p>
<p>ORE - Pantelis A Lemos - 90,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Bahrein $9.80 fio 24,000 shinc/20,000 shinc 25/4-5/5 GIIC.</p>
<p>Cape Cathay - 100,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Jubail $9.75 fio scale load/20,000 shinc 1-15/5 Hadeed (fixed recently).</p>
<p>IMC TBN - 60,000 tonnes ore New Mangalore/Kaohsiung $6.45 fio 30,000 shinc/38,000 shinc 24/4-5/5 China Steel.</p>
</text>
